== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating an Ogre Shadowknight, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Soonog now your master. . . Go to Soonog. . .Fight for Soonog. . .Fight for Greenbloods.

Upon handing the note to [[Soonog]]:

: [[Soonog]] says, 'Soonog own you now.. fight for Soonog.. Soonog make you power.. Soonog army rule all!'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Clurg]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Storm Guard]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Shadowknights of Night Keep]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Green Stained Skin Tunic*]]. Good luck, Shadowknight!

Note: You will need this for the [[Greenblood Shadowknight Tunic]] quest.

